        <mxCell id="a1dh" value="Dear Ms. Cruz,&#10;&#10;Mahal namin ang patuloy na suporta ng SM Foundation. In Q1 2026, your 3 contributions (~&#8369;153k) directly powered Brigada Eskwela (820 students reached) and the Lolomboy Health Caravan (340 individuals screened, 42 newly diagnosed).&#10;&#10;Mang Pedro&apos;s diabetes case &#8212; HbA1c 8.4 to 6.9 in 30 days &#8212; is one story we&apos;d love to share if you&apos;d like a longer write-up.&#10;&#10;Salamat po. Q2 plan attached in the Reports page.&#10;&#10;Maria Santos &#183; PARAYA Office" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=32;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="384" width="460" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
